From a9eb6d254023123b024ab7068b74826afa45c540 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent-speed <dev@agent-speed.local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:56:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] Add Command Code quota monitoring

Read Command Code CLI credentials (COMMAND_CODE_API_KEY or ~/.commandcode/auth.json) without writing them and query the /alpha whoami, credits and subscriptions routes on Windows, macOS and the Linux collector. Map remaining monthly, weekly and 5-hour allowances; keep purchased/free credits as a separate balance.

Adapted from Codenotch (MIT, commit 835550a342871779135b6484d6899161c5222f7c); license notices updated. Provider id is commandcode and remote sources keep credentials on the collector host.
